Package: journql
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: systemd, libc6
Maintainer: Michael Xymitoulias <michxymi@gmail.com>
Description: Query systemd journal logs with SQL via DuckDB
 journql wraps journalctl output and pipes it into a bundled DuckDB
 instance, allowing SQL queries over journal logs.
